meta {
  name: Milestones
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/method/implementor.client_api.get_milestones?project=PROJ-0029
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  project: PROJ-0029
  ~customer: Hamza
}

tests {
  test("returns 200", function () {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
  });
  
  test("has message", function () {
    expect(res.body).to.have.property("message");
  });
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  Returns a project's milestones and sign-off counts.
  
  **Endpoint:** `GET /api/method/implementor.client_api.get_milestones`  
  **Screen:** Milestones
  
  **Permission:** Signed-in client user (Client User or Client Admin). Only records of the user's own client company are returned.
  
  **Query parameters:**
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Example | Notes |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `project` | string | yes | `PROJ-0029` |  |
  | `customer` | string | no | `Hamza` | Client company. Send only when `me.customers` has more than one entry. Disabled by default. |
  
  **Response (trimmed):**
  
  ```json
  {
    "message": {
      "milestones": [ { "name": "...", "status": "Due", "can_sign_off": true, "signed_off": { "by": "...", "on": "2026-10-01" } } ],
      "signed_off": 2, "completed": 3, "total": 6
    }
  }
  ```
  
  **Errors:**
  
  - **401:** Token missing, expired or invalid. Refresh once and retry, else sign out.
  - **403:** Not this client's record, or role not allowed.
  - **404:** Project not found.
  
  **Notes:**
  
  - Status colors: Completed green; Due maroon ("Ready for sign-off" when `can_sign_off`); In Progress blue; Not Started, Partially Completed, On Hold grey.
}
